### 登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 刷新 Token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### 获取当前用户
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 用户列表（管理员）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 创建学生（管理员）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "role": "student",
  "username": "2023001001",
  "password": "123456",
  "real_name": "张三",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "profile": {
    "student_no": "2023001001",
    "gender": "male",
    "college": "计算机学院",
    "major": "软件工程",
    "grade": "2023",
    "class_name": "软工2301"
  }
}

### 修改本人密码
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "old_password": "123456",
  "new_password": "654321"
}
